Third-party material

  - Historical pictures (assets/media/, assets/room/portraits/): engravings,
    paintings, drawings and photographs, mostly public domain or Creative
    Commons from Wikimedia Commons. Each keeps its own licence, recorded with
    its artist, date and source in the folder's index.json or manifest.json
    and shown beside the picture in the app.
  - Fonts (assets/fonts/): Cinzel, Cormorant Garamond and IM Fell English,
    under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
  - Land outlines (assets/world/): derived from Natural Earth, public domain.
  - Draco decoder (assets/draco/): Google's Draco, Apache License 2.0.
  - npm dependencies: their own licences, as listed in pnpm-lock.yaml.
